    "note_models": "Compare (i) xxz_j1j2 = triangular-lattice J1–J2 Heisenberg/XXZ stack (J1 nn, J2 n.n.n.) vs (ii) anisotropic = bond-directional Jzz,Jpm,Jpmpm,Jzpm (YbMgGaO4-type) on the same datasets. Same C(T) windows → comparable chi-squared.",
